    "rationale": "Complete four-path unique remerge diff read, including both large core.c deletion hunks (1466-line rendered core patch) and non-conflict syscall/helper removal. Keep LTS function placement: syscall code in syscalls.c and CPU utilization in fair.c, not duplicate historical copies in core.c. Mapped 37 removed helper entries and 10 syscall entry bodies; 28 helper implementations plus one replaced helper and all 10 syscall bodies are native. Eight modified helpers are individually accounted for by current reviewed hooks/guards in this report. Retain current Android uclamp/nice/affinity/yield hooks and module exports at their native locations. Historical sched_getaffinity hook call is absent in final ACK as well as port; retain its declaration/export but do not invent an active call. Preserve KUnit header and task trace definition boundary. Retain Android max_load_balance_interval declaration; old !SMP stubs were subsequently removed from native tree, and SDK is SMP. Whole Makefile.modfinal equals LTS, retaining MODULE_PAHOLE_FLAGS and objtree vmlinux; local pinned Kleaf copies base-kernel outputs into OUT_DIR/objtree for mixed builds, making historical mixed-build-prefix unnecessary. Build145 verifies original workflow with this staging. Native copy_struct_to_user, permission/bounds checks, scoped guards and DL/affinity fixes are not replaced by 2024 implementations.",
    "evidence": [
      "evidence/scheduler-syscall-move-merge-review.json",
      "evidence/scx-lifecycle-contract-review.json",
      "evidence/affinity-hooks-review.json",
      "evidence/nice-hook-bounds-check.json",
      "SECURITY.md: Scheduler syscall-move merge"
    ]
  },
